+   deposit 10000 2 30 atom H 10 -0.1 2
+
+Example 3
+---------
+
 Deposit 5 H atoms and 5 C atoms every 5000 steps, at heights uniformly sampled between 30 Å and 40 Å in the z direction::
 
    deposit 5000 2 30 40 atom H 5 -0.1 C 5 -0.1
 
-Example 3
+Example 4
